msgstr "率先將吳迪心愛的斧頭扔向敵人。"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.BACONTOME.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.BACONTOME.NAME"
msgid "Tome of Beckoning"
msgstr "召喚之書"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.BACONTOME.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.BACONTOME.DESC"
