msgstr "使你的敵人嚇呆。"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.PETRIFYINGTOME.ABILITIES.PETRIFY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.PETRIFYINGTOME.ABILITIES.PETRIFY.NAME"
