msgstr "將它們扔向敵人, 看著他們爆炸！"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.BLACKSMITHSEDGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.BLACKSMITHSEDGE.NAME"
msgid "Blacksmith's Edge"
msgstr "鐵匠之刃"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.BLACKSMITHSEDGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.BLACKSMITHSEDGE.DESC"
