msgstr "生長一棵扎根的咬牙來咀嚼你的敵人。"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.TELEPORT_STAFF.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.TELEPORT_STAFF.NAME"
msgid "Teleport Staff"
msgstr "傳送魔杖"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.TELEPORT_STAFF.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.TELEPORT_STAFF.DESC"
msgid "Escape certain doom! For a price..."
msgstr "逃離某些厄運！要付出代價..."

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.TELEPORT_STAFF.ABILITIES.TELEPORT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.TELEPORT_STAFF.ABILITIES.TELEPORT.NAME"
msgid "Teleport"
msgstr "傳送"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.TELEPORT_STAFF.ABILITIES.TELEPORT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.TELEPORT_STAFF.ABILITIES.TELEPORT.DESC"
msgid "Travel wherever your puny heart desires."
msgstr "去任何你弱小的心靈想去的地方。"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.LAVAARENA_SPATULA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.LAVAARENA_SPATULA.NAME"
msgid "Spatula"
msgstr "鍋鏟"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.LAVAARENA_SPATULA.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.LAVAARENA_SPATULA.DESC"
msgid "Not great as a weapon, but it'll do with a pinch of salt."
msgstr "雖然不適合作武器, 但它能撒一點鹽。"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.LAVAARENA_SPATULA.ABILITIES.COOK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.LAVAARENA_SPATULA.ABILITIES.COOK.NAME"
msgid "Cook"
msgstr "烹飪"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.LAVAARENA_SPATULA.ABILITIES.COOK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.LAVAARENA_SPATULA.ABILITIES.COOK.DESC"
msgid "Cook food for all nearby players and feed them when ready."
msgstr "為附近的所有玩家烹飪食物, 並在準備好時喂給他們。"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.FORGE_TRIDENT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.FORGE_TRIDENT.NAME"
msgid "Trident"
msgstr "三叉戟"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.FORGE_TRIDENT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.FORGE_TRIDENT.DESC"
msgid "Don't let the rickety look fool you, this trident packs a punch!"
msgstr "不要讓它搖搖晃晃的樣子騙了你, 這個三叉戟威力很大！"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.FORGE_TRIDENT.ABILITIES.CALL_GUARDS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.FORGE_TRIDENT.ABILITIES.CALL_GUARDS.NAME"
msgid "Summon Merm Guard"
msgstr "召喚魚人守衛"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.FORGE_TRIDENT.ABILITIES.CALL_GUARDS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.FORGE_TRIDENT.ABILITIES.CALL_GUARDS.DESC"
msgid "Spawn a loyal Merm Guard to fight alongside you."
msgstr "生成一個忠誠的魚人守衛與你并肩作戰。"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.GAUNTLET.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.GAUNTLET.NAME"
msgid "Gauntlets"
msgstr "拳套"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.GAUNTLET.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.GAUNTLET.DESC"
msgid "Punch through foes with these Hands of Doom."
msgstr "用這些末日之手衝破敵人。"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.GAUNTLET.ABILITIES.BARRAGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.GAUNTLET.ABILITIES.BARRAGE.NAME"
msgid "Charged Punch"
msgstr "充能重拳"

#. STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.GAUNTLET.ABILITIES.BARRAGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.REFORGED.WEAPONS.GAUNTLET.ABILITIES.BARRAGE.DESC"
msgid "Lean into your punch to knockback anything in your path."
msgstr "用你的拳頭向前衝, 擊退道路上的一切。"

